hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2220","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aadmi ko lashkar par bheja. Jabke wo apne sahaaba ko unki namaz mein padhaata tha aur (Kaho: Wo Allah Aik hai) par khatm karta tha. Phir jab wo wapas aey to unhon-ne uska Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Us se poochho ke wo kis liye aisa karta hai? To unhon-ne us se poochha. To us ne kaha: Kyunke wo Rehman ki sifat hai. Aur main pasand karta hun ke use padhun. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use khabar do ke Allah us se mohabbat rakhta hai. (Bukhari: 7375)"
"2221","[AI-translation] Ashaari Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi Allah se zyada takleef par sabr karney wala nahi hai jo us ne suni hai. Wo uskey liye beta pukaartey hain, phir wo unhey aafiyat deta hai aur unhey rizq deta hai. (Bukhari: 7378)"
"2222","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaatey they: Main teri izzat ki panaah maangta hun jiskay siwa koi mabood nahi. Jo nahi marta jabke jinn aur insaan martay hain. (Bukhari: 7383)"
"2223","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab Allah ne makhlooq ko paida kya to apni Kitaab mein likha jabke wo apne aap par likhta hai. Jabke wo uskey paas Arsh par rakkhi hai: Beshak meri rehmat merey ghussay par ghaalib hai. (Bukhari: 7404)"
"2224","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala farmaata hai: Main apne bandey key gumaan key paas hun. Aur main uskey sath hun jab wo mujhey yaad karta hai. Phir agar wo mujhey apne dil mein yaad karey to main use apne dil mein yaad karta hun. Aur agar wo mujhey majlis mein yaad karey to main use un se behtar majlis mein yaad karta hun. Aur agar wo mujh se baalisht qareeb ho to main us se haath qareeb hota hun. Aur agar wo mujh se haath qareeb ho to main us se baanh qareeb hota hun. Aur agar wo merey paas chalta hua aaey to main uskey paas daudta hua aata hun. (Bukhari: 7405)"
"2225","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah farmaata hai: Jab mera banda buraai karney ka iraada karey to use us par na likho yahan tak ke wo use karey. Phir agar wo use karey to use us jaisi likho. Aur agar wo use meri wajah se chhorey to use uskey liye neki likho. Aur jab wo neki karney ka iraada karey aur use na karey to use uskey liye neki likho. Phir agar wo use karey to use uskey liye das guna tak likho, saat sau guna tak. (Bukhari: 7501)"
"2226","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak banda gunaah paata hai, aur baaz auqaat farmaya: Gunaah karta hai. To kahta hai: Ae merey Rab! Main ne gunaah kya, aur baaz auqaat farmaya: Main ne paaya. To mujhey maaf farma! To uska Rab farmaata hai: Kya merey bandey ne jaana ke uska Rab hai jo gunaah maaf karta hai aur us se pakadta hai? Main ne apne bandey ko maaf kar diya. Phir wo thehra jitna Allah ne chaaaha. Phir us ne gunaah paaya. Ya gunaah kya. To kahta hai: Ae merey Rab! Main ne gunaah kya. Ya main ne paaya. Doosra, to use maaf farma! To wo farmaata hai: Kya merey bandey ne jaana ke uska Rab hai jo gunaah maaf karta hai aur us se pakadta hai? Main ne apne bandey ko maaf kar diya. Phir wo thehra jitna Allah ne chaaaha, phir us ne gunaah kya, aur baaz auqaat farmaya: Gunaah paaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Us ne kaha: Ae merey Rab! Main ne paaya, ya kaha: Main ne gunaah kya. Doosra, to use merey liye maaf farma! To wo farmaata hai: Kya merey bandey ne jaana ke uska Rab hai jo gunaah maaf karta hai aur us se pakadta hai? Main ne apne bandey ko maaf kar diya. Teen martaba. To wo jo chaahey karey. (Bukhari: 7507)"
"2227","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab Qiyaamat ka din hoga to meri sifaarish ki jaaeygi aur main kahunga: Ae merey Rab! Jannat mein daakhil farma jiskay dil mein raai ho! To wo daakhil hongey. Phir main kahunga: Jannat mein daakhil farma jiskay dil mein kam cheez ho! To Anas ne kaha: Goya main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ungliyon ko dekh raha hun. (Bukhari: 7509)"
"2228","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne sifaarish ki hadees zikr ki aur wo Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) ki riwayat se lambi guzar chuki hai. Aur yahaan uskey aakhir mein badhaa diya: To wo Isa key paas aaeengey aur wo kahega: Main uskey liye nahi hun. Lekin tum par Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) laazim hain. To wo merey paas aaeengey aur main kahunga: Main uskey liye hun. To main apne Rab se ijazat maangunga aur mujhey ijazat di jaaeygi. Aur wo mujhey tareefein sikhayega jinkay sath main uski tareef karunga jo mujhey ab haazir nahi hain. To main uski un tareefon key sath tareef karunga. Aur uskey liye sajdey mein girunga. To wo farmaaeyga: Ae Muhammad! Apna sar uthao! Aur kaho, tumhaari suni jaaeygi. Aur maango, tumhey diya jaaeyga. Aur sifaarish karo, tumhaari qabool ki jaaeygi. To main kahunga: Ae merey Rab! Meri ummat, meri ummat! To wo farmaaeyga: Chalo! To us mein se nikaalo jiskay dil mein jau baraabar imaan ho! To main chalunga aur karunga. Phir wapas aaunga aur uski un tareefon key sath tareef karunga. Phir uskey liye sajdey mein girunga. To kaha jaaeyga: Ae Muhammad! Apna sar uthao! Aur kaho, tumhaari suni jaaeygi. Aur maango, tumhey diya jaaeyga. Aur sifaarish karo, tumhaari qabool ki jaaeygi. To main kahunga: Ae merey Rab! Meri ummat, meri ummat! To wo farmaaeyga: Chalo! To us mein se nikaalo jiskay dil mein zarra ya raai baraabar imaan ho! To use nikaalo! To main chalunga aur karunga. Phir wapas aaunga aur uski un tareefon key sath tareef karunga. Phir uskey liye sajdey mein girunga. To wo farmaaeyga: Ae Muhammad! Apna sar uthao! Aur kaho, tumhaari suni jaaeygi. Aur maango, tumhey diya jaaeyga. Aur sifaarish karo, tumhaari qabool ki jaaeygi. To main kahunga: Ae merey Rab! Meri ummat, meri ummat! To wo farmaaeyga: Chalo! To nikaalo jiskay dil mein kam kam kam raai key daaney baraabar imaan ho! To use aag se nikaalo! To main chalunga aur karunga. (Bukhari: 7510). Anas se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Haaritha key betey Zaid shikaayat karney aey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaaney lagey: Allah se daro aur apni biwi ko apne paas rakkho! Anas ne kaha: Kaash Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) cheez chhupaane walay hotey to isey chhupaatey. Unhon-ne kaha: Zainab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyon par fakhr kartin theen. Wo kehtin: Tumhey tumhaarey ghar walon ne biyaaha. Aur mujhey Allah Taala ne saat aasmanon key upar se biyaaha. Aur Saabit se riwayat hai: (Aur tum apne dil mein chhupaatey ho jo Allah zaahir karney wala hai aur tum logon se dartey ho): Zainab aur Zaid bin Haaritha key muamley mein naazil hui. (7420). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ham mein se nahi hai jo Quran se khush aawaazi na karey. Aur ghair ne badhaa diya: Use buland aawaaz se padhey. (7527). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2229","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai: Phir main chauthi martaba wapas aaunga. To uski un tareefon key sath uski tareef karunga. Phir uskey liye sajdey mein girunga. To kaha jaaeyga: Ae Muhammad! Apna sar uthao! Aur kaho, tumhaari suni jaaeygi. Aur maango, tumhey diya jaaeyga. Aur sifaarish karo, tumhaari qabool ki jaaeygi. To main kahunga: Ae merey Rab! Mujhey uskey baarey mein ijazat do jo (Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi) kahey. To wo farmaaeyga: Meri izzat aur meri buzurgi aur meri badai aur meri azmat ki qasam! Main zaroor us mein se nikaalunga jo (Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi) kahey."
"2230","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do kalimat zabaan par halkay hain, mizaan mein bhaari hain, Rehman ko mehboob hain: Allah paak hai aur uski hamd hai. Allah paak hai jo Azeem hai. (Bukhari: 7563). Musannif Sayyidna aur hamaarey Shaikh Imaam Allaama Haafiz Mutqin Abul Abbas Zainuddeen Ahmad bin Ahmad bin Abdul Lateef Sharji Zabaidi ne farmaya, Allah uska madadgaar ho aur use jaza dey: Main ne Shaabaan key muazzaz mahiney key chobeeswen budh ko san 889 mein usey mukhtasar karney se fursat paai. Alhamdu Lillah wahdahu, aur durood aur salaam us par jiskay baad Nabi nahi hai."
